<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8832" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coctūra</span></b> , ae, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				cooking; a melting; a manner</i> or <i>style of
				cooking</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 11, 3, 23, p. 453</span></i> Bip.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Apiciana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 8, 41, § 143</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">34, 8, 20,
				§ 96</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Apic. 6, 2 al.</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Pall. Nov. 1,
			3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A temperature of the air adapted to the
			ripening</i> (<i>of fruit</i>), <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 4,
				6, § 55</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> (Abstr. pro concr.) <i>A boiling
				liquid</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 12, 20, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">12, 18, 7</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
